Available models:
    openai/gpt-oss-20b
    openai/gpt-oss-120b
    qwen/qwen3.6-27b

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Is openai/gpt-oss-20b a Groq model?

Not exactly, prefix is essentially telling you who the model comes from.

This distinction is important.

openai/gpt-oss-20b means:

openai       → model developer
gpt-oss-20b  → model name

Groq provides the infrastructure/API to run that model.

Similarly, Groq can provide access to models developed by Meta, Qwen, OpenAI, etc.

